---
description: Prepare one recoverBrandConstraints evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: BrandProject[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Translate the client brief, product facts, and existing assets into desired associations and hard constraints. Separate aspirational positioning from demonstrable capability, identify legal or rights review needs, and preserve audience guidance without inferring personal traits. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
